1
00:00:02,070 --> 00:00:04,400
今天山姆·莱利踢足球
Today Sam Riley kicked a soccer ball...

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,780
狠狠砸中某小孩 他眼珠都爆出来了
and it hit another kid so hard his eye popped out.

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:08,620
帅呆了
Awesome!

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,119
是吗 眼珠真爆出来了吗
Really? His eye popped out.

5
00:00:11,119 --> 00:00:14,060
-算了 -钻被窝咯 明天周六大日子哎
- Never mind. - Well, gotta hit the sack. Big Saturday tomorrow.

6
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,260
没错 某人过生日
That's right. It's somebody's birthday.

7
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:18,660
不止生日 iPad要开卖了
Not just that. The iPad comes out-

8
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:19,940
就在我生日这天
on my actual birthday.

9
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:23,040
像是乔帮主和上帝勾肩搭背地说
It's like Steve Jobs and God got together to say,

10
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:23,760
"我们爱你哟 菲尔"
"We love you, Phil."

11
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,539
那玩意儿到底棒在哪儿
What is so great about that doohickey anyhow?

12
00:00:25,539 --> 00:00:27,113
"玩意儿" 艾丽·梅
"Doohickey," Elly May?

13
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,220
电影院 图书馆 音乐商店
It's a movie theater, a library and a music store...

14
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:34,160
都集成在那神奇的小本里
all rolled into one awesome pad.

15
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,800
图书馆知道吗 是个看书的地方
A library is a place where people get books.

16
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,880
电影院知道吗 是个约会的地方
A movie theater is a place where people go on dates.

17
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,820
我得把沙滩椅装到车里
I better load the beach chair into the trunk.

18
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,260
明早好坐着排队
I'm gonna need it for the line in the morning.

19
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,900
等等亲爱的
Wait, honey. Hang on.

20
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,820
你生日怎么能排一天队呢
You can't spend your birthday in line.

21
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:46,938
不会排一天啦
Well, not the whole day.

22
00:00:46,938 --> 00:00:49,316
我6点去 不用你惦记
I have to be there at 6:00, you'll forget about it.

23
00:00:49,316 --> 00:00:51,780
-10点就买到啦 -我去排怎么样
- Then I'm out by 10:00. - Why don't you let me do it?

24
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,460
克莱尔 没必要吧
Claire, you don't have to do that.

25
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:55,460
是没必要 但我想替你
No, I know, but I want to.

26
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:56,598
那样的话 你生日这天
And that way on your birthday

27
00:00:56,598 --> 00:00:59,845
一睁眼 面前就是新玩具啦
you'll wake up and you'll have your brand-new toy.

28
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,100
好吧
Okay.

29
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,960
你将之称作"玩具"是大不敬
Well, in spite of you calling it a toy,

30
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:07,560
但明天貌似会超过我曾过得最开心的一个生日
this is shaping up to top the best birthday I ever had.

31
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:11,059
感谢上帝 再不用听那故事
Oh, thank God we don't have to hear that stupid story

32
00:01:11,059 --> 00:01:12,682
-什么地方来着 -在欢乐地带球场
- about that place... - It was called the Fun Zone.

33
00:01:12,682 --> 00:01:13,705
那年我11岁
I was 11.

34
00:01:13,705 --> 00:01:16,888
连续击中10个直线快球
I hit 10 straight fastballs in the batting cage.

35
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,907
然后我的铁哥们杰夫·斯威尼冒出来
Then my best friend Jeff Sweeney stepped in

36
00:01:18,907 --> 00:01:19,999
被我正中胯下
and took one in the groin.

37
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:22,480
我喊道 又中两"球"
I yelled out "Ball two!"

38
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,060
所有人爆笑
Everybody laughed.

39
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,540
那时我就知道 我很搞笑
That was when I knew I was funny.

40
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:30,200
晚安
Good night.

41
00:01:31,363 --> 00:01:35,508
B-E-L-I-E-V-E 相信
B-E-L-I-E-V-E. Believe.

42
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:38,000
中间不是E-I吗 你确定吗
Are you sure there's not an "E-I" In the middle?

43
00:01:38,197 --> 00:01:40,187
- 不 是I-E -好样滴 宝贝
- No. It's "I-E." - Good, papi!

44
00:01:40,187 --> 00:01:43,576
我绕不晕你 你老师也别想成功
If I can't fool you, then your teachers can't fool you either.

45
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:45,220
老师没必要绕晕我吧
I don't think they're trying to fool me.

46
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:47,999
猜猜我给菲尔买了什么生日礼物
Wait until you see what I got Phil for his birthday.

47
00:01:47,999 --> 00:01:50,321
天维购物淘到的
I found it on the SkyMall catalog.

48
00:01:50,321 --> 00:01:53,262
啧啧 不是那种会说话的闹钟吧
Ay. It's not one of those talking alarm clocks?

49
00:01:53,262 --> 00:01:57,160
"6:05啦 6:25啦 醒醒啦醒醒啦"
"It's 6:05. It's 6:25. Wake up. Wake up."

50
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:59,920
比那个棒多了 一套紫檀木棋
Even better. A rosewood chess set.

51
00:02:00,020 --> 00:02:01,560
话说 不如我等会再包装
As matter of fact, before I wrap this thing,

52
00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:02,700
我们先来一局怎么样
what say we take it for a spin?

53
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,120
来吧曼尼 我教你
Come on, Manny. I'll teach you.

54
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:06,020
他会下的啦 他老爸教过的
He knows how to play. His father taught him.

55
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:08,540
我要教他正经下法 不是哥伦比亚版的
I'm gonna teach him real chess, not the Colombian version.

56
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,600
在我们这 棋子是用来下的
We actually use the pieces to play the game,

57
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,080
不是用来藏毒走私的
not smuggle stuff out of the country.

58
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:15,500
那你也少来玩我这哥伦比亚女子
I know one Colombian piece you won't be playing with later.

59
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,020
曼尼快来 试试你能耐
Manny, come on. Let's see what you got.

60
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,180
会让你大吃一惊的
You'll be surprised.

61
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:26,560
曼尼棋艺高超 杰的棋品可不咋滴
Manny's an excellent player, but Jay is a grumpy loser.

62
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:29,579
输了就生闷气 吊脸子 还摔门
He mopes, he makes the face, he slams the door,

63
00:02:29,579 --> 00:02:31,382
摔完门还不承认
then he said he didn't slam the door.

64
00:02:32,340 --> 00:02:33,800
让他赢比较好啦
It's better that he wins.

65
00:02:39,569 --> 00:02:41,187
我来
Um, I got this.

66
00:02:45,824 --> 00:02:47,699
没事的
Everything's gonna be okay.

67
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,860
好啦 别哭啦
It's okay. It's okay.

68
00:02:53,309 --> 00:02:55,059
-小卡 -别吵我
- Cam! - Leave me alone.

69
00:02:55,428 --> 00:02:58,140
莉莉 莉莉房里有个人
There's a...there's a man in Lily's room.

70
00:02:58,140 --> 00:02:59,860
莉莉房里有个人啊
There's a man in Lily's room!

71
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,180
大棒走起
It's go time.

72
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:13,880
感谢上帝
Oh, thank God.

73
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:16,920
是我是我 别打 是我
It's me, it's me, it's me, it's me.

74
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:18,380
她没事
She's fine.

75
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,580
邻居的监控器和我们串线了
We must have just heard a neighbor with the same monitor.

76
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:21,760
感谢上帝
Thank God.

77
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:24,100
老天 要是有蜘蛛闯入
Boy, if a spider would have broken in here,

78
00:03:24,140 --> 00:03:25,780
你捏个报纸也就能吓吓它而已
he would have been in trouble.

79
00:03:42,956 --> 00:03:44,820
灯光烧烤夹
Light-up barbecue tongs.

80
00:03:44,820 --> 00:03:46,420
我就给菲尔准备了这破礼物
This was the lame gift I got Phil.

81
00:03:47,056 --> 00:03:51,283
所以5点起床排队 我郁闷吗
So, was I bummed to get up at 5:00 and wait in line?

82
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:54,480
不 不会 我总算能给老公
No. No, because I was finally getting my husband

83
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:56,640
买到梦寐以求的礼物了
something that he really, really wanted.

84
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:59,140
我和他一样兴奋
I was every bit as excited as he was.

85
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,080
不行
No.

86
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:19,400
嘿 哥们
Hey, buddy.

87
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:22,140
昨天输给我 没生气吧
I hope you're not upset about our chess match yesterday.

88
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:23,460
再来一盘怎么样
Hey, what do you say we play again?

89
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:25,720
-我挺好 -态度不错
- I'm good. - That's the spirit.

90
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:27,940
我给你下载的
Downloaded this for you.

91
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,680
儿童级国际象棋入门
It's kind of a kid's guide to chess.

92
00:04:30,420 --> 00:04:31,840
不了 杰 我好得很
No, Jay. I'm good.

93
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:34,840
下棋不无聊的 可以很有趣嘛
Nah, it's not all dry like that. They have fun with it.

94
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:37,579
看 可以用蜡笔给小人上色呢
See, you can color in the little players with your crayons.

95
00:04:37,579 --> 00:04:39,680
还真让我兴趣大增
Now you are making me want to play again.

96
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,600
有兴趣就对了 我们来打个赌吧
Now we're lighting a fire. Let me toss this out.

97
00:04:42,540 --> 00:04:45,600
如果终有一天 你下赢了我
If you beat me, if that day should ever come,

98
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:47,240
我就给你...
I'll give you-

99
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:51,400
-你那块表 -哟 早看上了啊
- I want your watch. - Wow, you had that loaded up.

100
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,540
成 来吧
Okay. Game on.

101
00:04:57,420 --> 00:04:59,160
来 你先下
Now, I want you to go first.

102
00:04:59,260 --> 00:05:01,680
记住 努力清出中路
Now remember, try to open up the middle of the board.

103
00:05:01,758 --> 00:05:04,842
我觉得你该走两步
I'd have moved that guy two spaces.

104
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:05,700
更有攻击性
More aggressive.

105
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:09,260
皇后也别那么早出来
And you don't want to bring your queen out that quickly.

106
00:05:09,347 --> 00:05:12,380
看 它应该守在原地的
See, now you could've protected that with that,

107
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:13,280
它一动 就露了...
but now you're vulnerable-

108
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:16,160
-将军 -哈? 什么
- Checkmate. - Huh? What?

109
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:17,880
怎么将的
How'd you do that?

110
00:05:21,620 --> 00:05:23,500
你肯定猜不到
You will not believe what's going on

111
00:05:23,500 --> 00:05:24,500
杰克和黛比家出了什么事
at Jake and Debbie's house.

112
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:27,480
-谁 -和我们串线那家 肯定就住附近
-Who? -The people on the monitor. They must live nearby.

113
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,640
他家太狗血了
So much drama.

114
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:32,460
杰克跟黛比说 他要加班
Okay, Jake told Debbie that he had to work late.

115
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:33,600
黛比打给他老板
So she called his boss

116
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,560
发现没加班 抓包
and found out that he didn't. Busted!

117
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:37,700
她就打了一早上电话
So she spent all morning on the phone

118
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:39,700
跟她妈妈哭啊哭啊哭
crying and crying and crying to her mother...

119
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:42,460
说如果杰克再"加班"
and said if Jake has to work "late" one more time,

120
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,120
她就要离婚
she's filing for divorce.

121
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,680
就这样吗 我端上狗血大菜
That's it? I give you that tasty dish

122
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:49,856
你就只"哈"一声吗
and all you give me is a "Huh"?

123
00:05:49,856 --> 00:05:52,400
对不起小卡 昨晚我吓呆了
I-I'm s- Cam, I froze last night.

124
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,060
真是呆了
I froze.

125
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:55,800
我以为莉莉有危险 就吓呆了
I thought Lily was in danger and I froze.

126
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:57,820
可你没有 你立刻行动
But not you. No, you sprung right into action.

127
00:05:58,223 --> 00:06:00,520
居然还拉风地说了句"走起"
You even had the cool "It's go time" line.

128
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:02,880
那是本能啦 我做过一年交管员
That comes to me naturally. I spent a year as a crossing guard.

129
00:06:03,372 --> 00:06:05,060
小卡 我算是什么爸爸啊
Cam, I mean, what kind of parent am I

130
00:06:05,060 --> 00:06:07,900
连自己的家人都保护不了
if I can't even protect my own family, you know?

131
00:06:08,580 --> 00:06:11,280
我真想有那么一次无所畏惧
Just once I would love to be the guy with no fear...

132
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:14,800
站起来 该 该出手时就出手
who can stand up and, I don't know, you know, kick some ass.

133
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:16,517
你那小粉拳挥得真萌
You're so cute when you're angry with your little fists.

134
00:06:16,517 --> 00:06:18,319
真想把你装进口袋里
Just wanna put you in my pocket.

135
00:06:21,296 --> 00:06:22,220
老爸下楼了
Think he's coming.

136
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:24,200
-来了吗 -来了来了
- He's coming? - Here he comes.

137
00:06:24,265 --> 00:06:26,760
-老爸 -生日快乐
- Dad! - Happy birthday!

138
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,620
孩子们 帅呆了
You guys! That's awesome.

139
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,600
-谁送来的气球 -小卡和米奇尔
- Oh, who are these from? - Cam and Mitchell.

140
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,500
典型的基情温馨
Those guys are a class act.

141
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,560
我们给你做早餐呢
We're making you breakfast.

142
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:36,780
法式华夫饼哦
French waffle cakes.

143
00:06:36,780 --> 00:06:41,900
我猜猜 两片法式吐司夹华夫
Let me guess: One waffle in between two pieces of French toast

144
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:43,220
外面裹着煎饼
wrapped in a pancake.

145
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:44,420
全对
Nailed it.

146
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,860
过来吧孩儿们
Bring it in here, monkeys.

147
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:49,320
老爸爱你们 快过来
Love you! Get over here!

148
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,560
真棒
Good enough.

149
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,380
老妈人呢
Where's Mom?

150
00:06:51,780 --> 00:06:53,200
你是说史上最棒的女人吗
You mean the greatest woman in the world?

151
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:56,020
正在苹果店门外排队呢
She is standing in line at the Apple Store,

152
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:58,240
要实现我所有的生日愿望
making all my birthday wishes come true.

153
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,268
看看味道怎样
Let's see how these bad boys taste.

154
00:07:00,268 --> 00:07:01,600
-别碰 -老天 烫
- Oh, no... - Son of a... Oh! It's hot!

155
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:05,600
-没事吧 -刚出炉是吧 真是
- Are you okay? - Fresh out of the oven? That is...

156
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:07,360
-要冰块吗 -要
- Do you want some ice? - Yes.

157
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,320
靠 真是...
Oh, man! This...

158
00:07:09,752 --> 00:07:11,968
-舒服多了 舒服舒服 -对不起 老爸
- Oh, that feels better. That feels better. - Sorry, Dad.

159
00:07:12,300 --> 00:07:14,760
没有 太诡异了
No, it actually- That feels weird.

160
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:16,000
换了种疼法
That burns in a different way!

161
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:20,740
烤盘别洗啊 我皮还黏在上面呢
Don't wash this until we see if I can get my skin back. Okay?

162
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,480
让我看看
Let me see it!

163
00:07:27,132 --> 00:07:28,820
不行 派对要晚上才开始呢
No! Your party's not until tonight.

164
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:29,880
你得等等
You're just gonna have to wait.

165
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:31,580
让我看看包装袋嘛 留在车里了吗
Just let me see the bag. Did you leave it in the car?

166
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,380
-对啊 -谁招待你的
- Yeah! - Hey, who'd you deal with?

167
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:35,180
是叫莫哈吗 他们管他叫"兽男"
Was it a guy named Mehar? They call him "The beast."

168
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:37,260
矮个子 他肯定忙着疯狂搬货
He's a tiny guy. He must've move a ton of product.

169
00:07:38,263 --> 00:07:39,923
吊胃口哈 我喜欢
I kinda love that you're making me wait.

170
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,880
你是史上最棒老婆啦
You are the best wife ever!

171
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:44,240
史上最棒 绝对的
You are the best wife ever!

172
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,440
我没买到iPad
I didn't get you the iPad.

173
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:49,040
我到的时候已经卖光了
I got to the store and they were all out.

174
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:49,940
真对不起
I'm so sorry.

175
00:07:49,961 --> 00:07:52,477
我不懂 我网友都买到了
I don't understand. My online buddies got it.

176
00:07:52,637 --> 00:07:55,120
高考落榜君和机器兄8点才到店里
SAT800 and Brobot didn't get there until 8:00.

177
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,459
你肯定比他们早
And you definitely got there before they did,

178
00:07:56,459 --> 00:07:57,943
你不是六点半就去了
because you got there at 6:30.

179
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:01,180
不不不 你没早去吗 你上哪去了
No, no, no! You didn't get there at 6:30? Where were you?

180
00:08:01,527 --> 00:08:02,860
我闹钟定了五点的
I set the alarm for 5:00.

181
00:08:02,860 --> 00:08:04,680
起床下楼 结果又睡着了
I got up, I came downstairs, I fell asleep.

182
00:08:05,980 --> 00:08:07,200
不要啊 老天爷
No! Oh, my goodness.

183
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,978
我做了什么 我做了什么
What have I done? What have I done?

184
00:08:08,978 --> 00:08:10,295
-我该自己去的 -亲爱的 没事
- I should've done this myself. - Sweetie, you know what?

185
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,360
下周会补货的呀
They're gonna get more in next week.

186
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,240
下周
Next week?

187
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,840
让抢鲜族等下周 你太残忍了
That's the worst thing you can say to an early adopter.

188
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,020
你上哪去
Where are you going?

189
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:20,280
去找个重视别人生日的地方
To a place where birthdays still mean something.

190
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:31,380
我去开门
I'll get that.

191
00:08:32,295 --> 00:08:33,441
-曼尼 -米奇尔
- Hi, Manny. - Mitchell?

192
00:08:33,620 --> 00:08:35,320
你有何贵干呀
What are you doing here at...

193
00:08:35,762 --> 00:08:38,030
现在时间 周六下午4点17分
4:17 on a Saturday afternoon?

194
00:08:38,030 --> 00:08:40,901
我来还老爸的工具包
Oh, I'm just returning my dad's belt of tools, so-

195
00:08:41,091 --> 00:08:43,480
周六下午4点17分吗
At 4:17 on a Saturday afternoon?

196
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:45,420
你没别的事可干了吗
Don't you have something better to do?

197
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:49,940
-装扮成功吗 -什么
- So, were you a big hit? - What do you mean?

198
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:52,440
你借这玩意多半是参加化妆派对嘛
Well, I just assumed there was some kind of costume party.

199
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:53,720
小卡扮印度阿三是不
Was Cam the Indian?

200
00:08:53,860 --> 00:08:55,480
不 跟你说 爸
No. For your information, Dad,

201
00:08:55,500 --> 00:08:57,600
我们确实是在家建了东西
we were actually doing a little construction at the house.

202
00:08:58,020 --> 00:08:58,537
建了什么
What'd you build?

203
00:08:58,537 --> 00:09:00,580
礼品包装小站
A gift-wrapping station.

204
00:09:00,580 --> 00:09:01,580
真够基情的哈
And we're back.

205
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:04,620
-谢了 -不客气
- So, thank you for that. - You're welcome.

206
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:08,960
老爸 你记不记得我11岁时
Hey, uh, Dad, do you remember when I was, probably 11...

207
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,980
你教我拳击 我半途而废来着
and you were teaching me how to fight, and then I quit?

208
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:13,104
是啊 你说你要学的招数
Yeah, when you said everything you needed to learn

209
00:09:13,104 --> 00:09:14,600
《西区故事》那种歌舞片里都有
you'd learn from West Side Story.

210
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,744
-对 -花拳绣腿好用吗
- Yeah. - How'd that work out for you?

211
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:18,400
哪天斗了舞 一定告诉你
If I'm ever in a dance fight, I'll let you know.

212
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:23,305
那 你还想教我吗
So, yeah- Is the offer, uh, still good?

213
00:09:23,431 --> 00:09:25,500
怎么了 你和小卡闹矛盾啦
Why? What's the matter? You got problems with Cam?

214
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:27,780
怎么会呢 你咋猜那个
No! Why would you say that?

215
00:09:27,780 --> 00:09:31,169
拜托 和男人同居哎
Well, come on. I mean, you know, sharing a room with a guy?

216
00:09:31,220 --> 00:09:33,740
我跟我弟弟睡过上下铺 天天暴力
I bunked with my brother. I know that can get pretty rough.

217
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,340
我和小卡可不睡上下铺
I don't "bunk" with Cam.

218
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:37,960
爸 我就是想学点自卫术
Dad, I just wanna learn a little self-defense, you know.

219
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,160
还记得哪招 耍来看看
Show me what you remember.

220
00:09:39,854 --> 00:09:41,582
-现 现在吗 -来吧
- Right now? - Yeah.

221
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:46,260
好吧 老天 拇指外扣
Okay, uh- Gosh, uh- Thumbs out.

222
00:09:46,260 --> 00:09:47,933
-没错 乖仔 -然后
- Thumbs. Attaboy. - And then-

223
00:09:54,487 --> 00:09:56,200
不咋漂亮 是不
That wasn't- That wasn't very pretty, was it?

224
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,580
其实 恐怕是太"漂亮"了
You know what? Maybe it was a little too pretty.

225
00:09:58,640 --> 00:09:59,480
没错
That's the thing.

226
00:09:59,852 --> 00:10:02,138
起飞了哈
Here it goes.

227
00:10:02,238 --> 00:10:03,860
老天
Oh! Oh, man!

228
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:04,440
哥们
Buddy!

229
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:08,220
你起跳点太低了 才没飞起来
Think the problem is, you're not jumping from high enough.

230
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:10,580
去车库顶试试
You should get on top of the garage.

231
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:12,200
艾丽克斯 别害你小弟了
Alex, stop trying to kill your brother.

232
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,360
各位 妈妈要求助你们
Listen, guys, I need your help.

233
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:15,480
得给老爸找个iPad来
We've gotta find your dad one of those iPad thingies.

234
00:10:15,900 --> 00:10:17,640
海莉 给你朋友群发短信
So, Haley, text everyone you know.

235
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:20,600
艾丽克斯 Facebook 推特什么的都发一圈
Alex? Facebook, chat, tweet, buzz, bling,

236
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:22,100
我不懂那些玩意 你要通过一切渠道
I don't know! Just do what you have to do.

237
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:24,140
千万找个iPad来 好吗
We have got to find one of these iPads. Okay?

238
00:10:24,140 --> 00:10:26,460
卢克小可爱 别挡路
Luke? Sweetie, that means stay out of everyone's way

239
00:10:26,460 --> 00:10:27,980
也别吸氢气
and stop inhaling the balloons.

240
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:30,120
我哪有吸氢气
I'm not inhaling them.

241
00:10:30,180 --> 00:10:31,000
少撒谎了
Stop lying.

242
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:34,980
她怎么发现的
How did she know?

243
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:41,320
妈妈有没教你 别坐陌生人的车
Didn't your mama teach you never to take a ride from a stranger?

244
00:10:41,940 --> 00:10:43,780
快放假了吧
Got a little vacation time coming up?

245
00:10:44,020 --> 00:10:45,400
上月球好好玩吧
Have fun on the moon!

246
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:47,360
最近身体不爽是吗
Not feeling too well lately?

247
00:10:47,860 --> 00:10:49,780
来看看医生
Maybe you should come see the doctor...

248
00:10:49,780 --> 00:10:52,840
哥帮你解决
and I'll get rid of it!

249
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,900
你瞎嚷嚷啥呢
What's that supposed to mean?

250
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:01,280
请注意 参加菲尔生日派对的朋友们
Attention. If you're here for Phil's birthday party,

251
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,140
请到野餐区集合
they're gathering in the picnic area.

252
00:11:03,780 --> 00:11:04,720
菲尔的生日派对
Phil's birthday party.

253
00:11:05,420 --> 00:11:06,780
我老婆知道我会来这
My wife knew I'd be here.

254
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:08,960
给我准备了派对哎
She put together a whole party for me.

255
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:11,240
这能弥补iPad的事儿吗
Does that really make up for not getting an iPad?

256
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,560
我跟你交心了 你可别挑拨我们
Don't make me sorry I shared that with you. Okay?

257
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:15,780
拜啦各位
See you, fellas.

258
00:11:20,393 --> 00:11:21,705
侬好呀
Howdy-do!

259
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:25,320
广播说菲尔的生日派对在这
I just heard the announcement for Phil's birthday party.

260
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:27,380
对的 拐弯就是
Oh, yeah. It's right around the corner.

261
00:11:27,980 --> 00:11:28,560
-太棒了 -好好玩
- Awesome. - Have fun!

262
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:31,080
谢谢你 美女
Thank you. Thanks, my lady.

263
00:11:36,895 --> 00:11:39,388
冰激凌蛋糕吗 真棒
Ice-cream cake? Ice-cream cake's good.

264
00:11:40,099 --> 00:11:42,232
菲尔 生日快乐
Happy birthday, Phil!

265
00:11:43,060 --> 00:11:45,060
太帅了
This is awesome!

266
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:50,500
-生日快乐 -生日快乐
- Happy birthday! - Happy birthday!

267
00:11:52,967 --> 00:11:54,189
生日快乐 宝贝
Happy birthday, sweetie.

268
00:11:54,238 --> 00:11:55,526
-生日快乐 -玩得开心呀
- Happy birthday. - Have a really good birthday.

269
00:11:55,616 --> 00:11:57,555
-看到蛋糕了吗 -超棒的
- Did you see the cake? - Oh, yeah. It's great.

270
00:11:59,940 --> 00:12:00,380
喂
Hello?

271
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,620
没事 我哄小孩睡觉呢
No, that's fine, I'm just putting the baby down.

272
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,980
那是杰克 出轨的那个
Okay, that's Jake. He's the one that's having an affair.

273
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,960
-我知道的 -明晚没问题
- I know. - Yeah, I can do it tomorrow night.

274
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,880
向我老婆编个谎就行
I'll just give my wife some excuse.

275
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:13,460
混蛋汉子
Men are pigs.

276
00:12:13,820 --> 00:12:15,580
-那也没办法 -有呀
- I don't really have a choice, do I? - Yeah.

277
00:12:15,580 --> 00:12:17,700
别劈腿不行吗
You could not cheat on her! How about that?

278
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:19,317
我得给她个惊喜嘛
Because it has to be a surprise.

279
00:12:19,317 --> 00:12:21,880
等我跟她外婆说起意大利语
When she hears me speaking Italian to her grandmother,

280
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,980
我偷偷摸摸这么长时间也值了
it'll be worth all this sneaking around.

281
00:12:24,340 --> 00:12:26,040
莉莉 我猜错了 他是个好男人啊
Lily, I had it backwards. He's wonderful.

282
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:28,040
别担心 我就说要加班
Don't worry. I'll just tell her I'm working late.

283
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:29,400
不行杰克 别那么说
No, Jake, don't do that.

284
00:12:29,420 --> 00:12:30,640
说加班你就惨了
That's the worst thing you could do.

285
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:31,560
晚安啦[意大利语]
Buonanotte.

286
00:12:31,759 --> 00:12:33,677
坏了莉莉 我们要怎么办
Oh, no, Lily, what are we gonna do?

287
00:12:33,940 --> 00:12:35,380
得帮帮他们啊
We have to fix this.

288
00:12:37,307 --> 00:12:38,771
米奇尔 我就教你几招
Okay, Mitchell, I'm gonna teach you

289
00:12:38,771 --> 00:12:41,364
基本的巴西柔术吧
a couple of basic Brazilian jiu-jitsu moves.

290
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:44,820
现在 来打我
Now, just attack me.

291
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:45,715
什么
I'm sorry- What?

292
00:12:45,715 --> 00:12:48,320
释放你内心的怨恨
Take any deep-seated anger you may have,

293
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,639
冲过来打我吧
get a running start and come at me.

294
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:51,140
老爸 我没记恨过你啊
Dad, I don't have any deep-seated anger.

295
00:12:51,140 --> 00:12:52,160
记得那次万圣节
Remember that Halloween when

296
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:53,719
我不让你扮奥利维亚·纽顿-约翰吗
I wouldn't let you go as Olivia Newton-John?

297
00:12:55,700 --> 00:12:58,640
懂了吧 借力打力
You see what I did? I used your momentum against you.

298
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:00,497
格雷西柔术创始人教我的
I learned this choke from the Gracie brothers.

299
00:13:00,497 --> 00:13:02,668
这招叫"伏狮锁"
It's called the lion killer- mata lella.

300
00:13:03,980 --> 00:13:06,220
-懂 -试试挣脱 挣一下
- Okay. - Now try to get out. Try to get out.

301
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:07,980
-难不 -挣不开
- See? - I can't.

302
00:13:08,060 --> 00:13:09,497
挣不开就对了
Yeah, all right. Now-

303
00:13:09,497 --> 00:13:10,980
-我要晕了 -这招就厉害在
- Passing out... - See, the beauty of this is,

304
00:13:10,980 --> 00:13:12,180
你不用贸然攻击
you don't have to make the first move.

305
00:13:12,509 --> 00:13:15,381
对手可能会轻敌嘛
You know, chances are your opponent's gonna be overconfident.

306
00:13:15,381 --> 00:13:16,960
以为你是个菜鸟
He's gonna think you don't know anything.

307
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:19,580
反而被骗 就显得很二
Basically, he's being suckered into thinking-

308
00:13:20,020 --> 00:13:23,220
曼尼 曼尼这小子耍我
Manny. Manny, that little bastard, he hustled me.

309
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:25,700
糟
Oh, crap.

310
00:13:26,502 --> 00:13:29,247
糟了 米奇尔
Ah, crap. Mitchell!

311
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:33,880
得 吸气 加油
Oh, crap. All right. Come on. Breathe.

312
00:13:34,083 --> 00:13:37,100
好小子 快醒来
Attaboy. You all right? Coming around.

313
00:13:37,260 --> 00:13:39,020
-我怎么趴地上了 -醒过来 米奇尔
- Why am I on the floor?- Come on, Mitchell.

314
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:43,800
海莉 我又没买着
Haley, I just struck out again.

315
00:13:43,860 --> 00:13:45,213
拜托给点好消息
Please tell me you have some good news.

316
00:13:45,213 --> 00:13:47,200
格氏又进了一批货
Okay, so The Grove just got a new shipment.

317
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:48,540
我短信你地址
I'm texting you the directions now.

318
00:13:49,177 --> 00:13:52,077
很好 很好 真棒真棒
Oh! Okay, that's good. That's good. That's good.

319
00:13:53,312 --> 00:13:55,375
我这就去 立刻滚去
I'm there. I'm on that.

320
00:13:59,780 --> 00:14:01,180
那小子把我手表骗走了
That kid stole my watch.

321
00:14:01,380 --> 00:14:01,880
-啥 -什么
- Huh? - What?

322
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,680
他骗我跟他下棋
He hustled me at chess.

323
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:06,920
你不是保证让他赢吗
I thought you promised you were gonna let him win.

324
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:09,540
-我让他赢了一盘 -等等 你也知道
- I did the first time. - Wait a minute. You're in on it too?

325
00:14:10,300 --> 00:14:11,640
曼尼 换派对衣服去
Manny, go and get dressed for the party.

326
00:14:11,780 --> 00:14:12,860
能洗个澡吗
Do I have time for a steam?

327
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,680
-行 但要快 -好
- Yeah, but a quick one. - Okay.

328
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,620
干嘛叫他输给我
Why tell him to lose to me?

329
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:18,760
你一输棋就发小孩脾气
Because you're like a baby when you don't win.

330
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:20,659
乱踢东西 皱眉头
With the kicking and the eyebrows...

331
00:14:20,659 --> 00:14:23,112
还狂吃瓜子
and the angry eating of the sunflower seeds.

332
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:25,180
不是那样的
Actually, that's not true.

333
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:29,040
输给小天才 我怎么会不服气呢
I don't mind losing to a chess genius, which Manny obviously is.

334
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,260
他天才 他还没我下得好呢
Chess genius? He's not even as good as I am.

335
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:32,340
你下棋不怎么样啊
You're not that good in chess.

336
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:34,760
-蜜月那次输给我了啊 -我让你的
- I beat you on our honeymoon. - Or did I let you win?

337
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:36,460
你才没让我
You didn't let me win.

338
00:14:37,776 --> 00:14:41,421
我干嘛要把皇后送入你的魔爪 杰
Why would I sacrifice my queen for your pawn, Jay?

339
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:49,660
别哼了
Stop saying that.

340
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:57,602
卢克 宝贝 怎么了
Luke, honey, hi. What's going on?

341
00:14:57,602 --> 00:14:59,250
老爸的蛋糕送来了
They guy came with Dad's cake,

342
00:14:59,340 --> 00:15:01,660
可它缺了一块
but just so you know, it's missing a piece.

343
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:04,440
-你偷吃老爸蛋糕了吗 -没啊
- Luke, did you take a bite out of your father's cake? - No.

344
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:06,900
-别撒谎 卢克 -我哪有
- Stop lying, Luke. - I'm not lying.

345
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:09,820
哦对 我用你的卡付了钱
By the way, I used your credit card to pay him.

346
00:15:09,900 --> 00:15:10,620
没问题吧
Is that all right?

347
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:12,540
没问题啊
Oh, no, that's fine.

348
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:14,800
